gamescope:

  gs/gamescope-rdx.patch is a patch to gamescope (https://github.com/ValveSoftware/gamescope,
  BSD-2-Clause). The patch is provided under gamescope's BSD-2-Clause license. gs/build_gamescope.sh
  downloads gamescope with its submodules (wlroots, libliftoff, vkroots, ...), Xwayland with
  xorgproto, and - where the system's are too old - wayland, libdrm, wayland-protocols,
  libxkbcommon and pixman from their upstream repositories at build time; they keep their own
  licenses. Nothing of them is part of this repository.

